const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"比较公司，不是预测下一天",en:"Compare firms, not tomorrow"},body:{zh:"Fama与French研究公司之间平均收益的差异，比较市场贝塔、规模、账面市值比、杠杆和盈利价格比。横截面问题与预测某只股票下一天的价格不同，也不等于解释每一次日内波动。",en:"Fama and French compare average returns across firms using beta, size, book-to-market, leverage and earnings-price ratios. This cross-sectional question differs from forecasting tomorrow's price or explaining every intraday move."}},{title:{zh:"两个市值日期，各有用途",en:"Two capitalization dates serve different roles"},body:{zh:"样本取CRSP与COMPUSTAT交集中的非金融企业。作者用上一年12月市值计算账面市值比等比率，用本年6月市值衡量规模，再对应7月起的收益。财务年度、比率分母日期和分组日期因此不是同一个时间；混用它们就改变了比较对象。",en:"The sample intersects CRSP and COMPUSTAT for nonfinancial firms. Prior-December capitalization enters accounting ratios; June capitalization measures size before returns beginning in July. Fiscal year, ratio denominator date and sorting date therefore play distinct roles. Collapsing them into one date changes the comparison."},reference:{url:"https://www.ivey.uwo.ca/media/3775518/the_cross-section_of_expected_stock_returns.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第I.A节：样本与日期对齐",en:"Original §I.A: sample and date alignment"}}},{title:{zh:"把相互重叠的解释放在一起",en:"Test overlapping explanations"},body:{zh:"这些变量往往共享价格或公司规模信息。分别显著不意味着各自提供独立解释；作者把它们联合考察，并区分与规模相关及无关的贝塔变化。理解这种比较，比记住某一个系数更重要。",en:"Several variables share price or size information. Separate significance does not establish independent explanatory content. Joint tests and beta variation distinct from size help disentangle their roles."}},{title:{zh:"样本结论与经济解释分开",en:"Separate finding from mechanism"},body:{zh:"在1963—1990年的美国样本中，规模与账面市值比刻画了多项变量所关联的平均收益差异；市场贝塔的关系较弱。作者讨论风险与非理性定价两类解释，不能把统计关联直接定性为某一种机制。",en:"In the 1963–1990 US sample, size and book-to-market capture return differences associated with several variables, while beta's relation is weak. Risk and mispricing remain competing interpretations of those associations."}},{title:{zh:"组合贝塔不是当时的个股预测",en:"Portfolio betas are not contemporaneous forecasts"},body:{zh:"作者先按规模与预排序贝塔分组，再把组合的全样本后排序贝塔赋给组内股票，用于逐月横截面检验。这样做旨在提高测量精度，不是为每个历史时点生成可实时使用的输入。若改做时点一致分析，贝塔估计窗口也必须限制在当时已知的数据内。",en:"Stocks receive full-sample post-ranking betas from portfolios formed on size and pre-ranking beta. This improves measurement for monthly cross-sectional tests; it does not create real-time historical inputs. Editorial application: a point-in-time design must separately restrict beta estimation to observations already available at each date."},reference:{url:"https://www.ivey.uwo.ca/media/3775518/the_cross-section_of_expected_stock_returns.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第I.B.1节：贝塔估计与赋值",en:"Original §I.B.1: beta estimation and assignment"}}},{title:{zh:"与1993年论文对照阅读",en:"Read alongside the 1993 paper"},body:{zh:"这篇以公司特征和横截面为中心，1993年论文进一步研究因子组合收益的时间序列解释力。本站建议记录财务数据披露时点与市值日期，避免用后来修订的账面值去解释当时可得的信息。",en:"This paper centers on characteristics and cross-sections; the 1993 study examines factor-return time series. Preserve accounting availability and capitalization dates so later revisions do not silently enter historical information sets."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"历史关联既不识别唯一原因，也不保证其他市场或未来时期的表现；公司特征不等同于因子载荷。",en:"Historical associations neither identify one cause nor establish transfer to other markets or periods; characteristics are not factor loadings."}};export{e as default};
